    "zh": "Codex 客户端内置快捷键完整清单。同一按键可能绑定多个命令（如 Ctrl+K 与 Ctrl+Shift+P 均可打开命令菜单）。",
    "en": "Full Codex client shortcut list from settings screenshots. Some keys map to multiple commands."
